title: "CARE-ASD: Causal Acoustic-Path and Reliability-Calibrated Anomalous Sound Detection"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-06"
type: software
abstract: >-
  CARE-ASD implements causal acoustic-path estimation, reliability-calibrated
  anomaly detection, and selective edge inference for unsupervised anomalous
  sound detection on unseen machines (DCASE 2026 Task 2).
keywords:
  - anomalous sound detection
  - acoustic path
  - reliability calibration
  - DCASE
  - machine condition monitoring
